{
  "_comment": [
    "MAGP signed-authorize-message conformance vectors (spec section 8.3).",
    "Generated from backend/src/policy-core/canonical.ts buildAuthMessage, which is the source of truth.",
    "Every implementation (backend TypeScript, the Python client, any third-party client) MUST reproduce `message` from `fields`, and Ed25519 over the UTF-8 bytes of `message` with `seed` MUST equal `signature`.",
    "The seed is the public RFC 8032 section 7.1 test vector 1 key. It is a test key, never a secret, and must never be used for a real agent.",
    "The suite that reads this file: backend/src/policy-core/authorize-vectors.test.ts and integrations/metamynd-client/tests/test_protocol_vectors.py. Change the message format and both fail until this file is regenerated."
  ],
